see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_basics.vox".
see "../src/gen_keywords.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".
see "../src/gen_process.vox".
see "../src/gen_expressions.vox".

(expressions leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/expressions.md rows EXP-05,
 06, 07, 10, 14, 15, 16, 27, 36, 46, 51, 94, 98. Kinds 280-288.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, the
 same convention tests/300_gen_buffers_a.vox and tests/450_gen_process_a.vox
 use. Seeds are hand-picked to show both sides of every branch a leaf
 draws, not just the first seed that compiles.)

Print "--- EXP-05, EXP-14: hex literal, initializer and operand position ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf hex literal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf hex literal' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-06, EXP-15: binary literal, initializer and operand position ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf binary literal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-07, EXP-16: character literal, initializer and operand position ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf character literal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-10: boolean arithmetic, the drawn literal is false ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf boolean arithmetic' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed that draws true ---".
'rng seed' of 51.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf boolean arithmetic' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-46: not <condition>, the raw comparison holds (not-branch must not fire) ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf not condition' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, the raw comparison does not hold (not-branch must fire) ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf not condition' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-27, EXP-36: the optional article, arithmetic and comparison agreement ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf optional article agreement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-51: plural are-form vs written-out conjunction ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf plural are expansion' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed that draws a different subject count ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf plural are expansion' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-94: round half up, fraction below .50 (truncates down) ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf round half up' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed with fraction at or above .50 (rounds up) ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf round half up' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, the extreme-value cliff: whole part is i64::MAX, float64 cannot represent it exactly, the naive oracle diverges (documented candidate, see report) ---".
'rng seed' of 45.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf round half up' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- EXP-98: a bare number in condition position, zero ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf bare number condition' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, negative ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf bare number condition' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, positive ---".
'rng seed' of 13.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf bare number condition' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- registration reachable: kinds 280-288 all dispatch without error ---".
a number called 'the kind' is 280.
While 'the kind' is less than 289,
    clear gen_out,
    'gen dispatch leaf' of 'the kind' and "" and false,
    Print "kind {'the kind'}: {gen_out's length} bytes emitted",
    Set 'the kind' to 'the kind' add 1.
